{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b2dfc7567250e38ef3e1bc376044724429e78e461450d8955a364aacfcbbee60", "ja": "（アイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケに、\n海美とやってきた。撮影は順調に進んでいる）", "zh": "（和海美一起来到了偶像写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的外景拍摄地点，拍摄进行得很顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "190e4af1f893bc8932595be3bc0a38312aa07863e5488818c67cb4ddf5c3e174", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\nちょっと休憩だって。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n说是稍微休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d6f16460a4666a300a97d17f98d2d20134dcef08001e9db73d3ca04c8f3dab1", "ja": "うーっ、はやく再開しないかな？\nウズウズしちゃう～っ！", "zh": "唔——好想快点继续啊？\n真是坐立难安～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1003_p", "source_sha256": "170ca33cccb4435fca88479fc5b7bc0b8f92ac8f9dec6fb76981947017216988", "ja": "お疲れさま。そんなに焦らなくても、\nうまくいってるじゃないか。", "zh": "辛苦了。也不用那么着急嘛，进展不是挺顺利的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "0e1eee61fdac5fc64e63a96dea1c0c9ad39d28d6dbf089435ea723aefc673fa4", "ja": "焦ってないよ、楽しくてしょうがないの！\nだから、じっとしてられないよ～！", "zh": "我才没有着急呢，只是开心得不得了！\n所以根本闲不住嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1005_p", "source_sha256": "81517f0496ef34b35526309f93cc23d36b701a17d577fbd640a551530d860b0a", "ja": "なるほど、そっちか。\n海美、確かにすごく楽しそうだよな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。海美，确实看起来特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "9e3011042f9ad7fa033d33e4fee6ef210d1eeaaacba03a72bd195f42cfe2a33a", "ja": "うん！　今日の撮影、ずっと楽しみだったから。\nだって、ウェイトレスだよ？　オシャレだよ！", "zh": "嗯！因为我一直都很期待今天的拍摄。\n毕竟，是女服务生装啊？很时髦吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "c3ed3518a4df246b99e1ff275357c38e88a8f3605c12125a35778e0b84f3ec8d", "ja": "女子力も高いし、憧れてたんだ。\nしかも、こんなにカワイイ衣装までもらえて……。", "zh": "女子力也很高，我一直都很向往呢。\n而且，还能穿上这么可爱的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "22cd4275099ce5f57f83a3e3e955af414e1c351e100a0134b8ffefcca9563cb2", "ja": "も～、すっごくうれしいの！", "zh": "真是的～，我超级开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7478f354a118baf5dbdade2557e2613025ada54e47ee66a7cc4d8a668e4fc5fe", "ja": "はは、そんなに喜んでくれると、\nなんだかこっちまで嬉しくなってくるな！", "zh": "哈哈，你这么开心，\n连我也不知不觉跟着高兴起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "1d6d3deecc4cc1f9d1fe9a7e194b03279008e74cd1d94cff6d50b9f4b4a4002d", "ja": "それなら私だって、{$P$}が\n喜んでくれて、もっともっとうれしいよ！", "zh": "那样的话，我也会因为{$P$}先生这么开心，而变得更加更加开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1011_p", "source_sha256": "24207dd4b2b054052b40e54ba210bf0cb52a686f1c4321fa9c048c67043355e8", "ja": "嬉しさがエンドレスになりそうだな。\nまあとにかく、ちょっと落ち着いて休もうか。", "zh": "这份开心感觉要没完没了了呢。\n总之，先稍微冷静下来休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "b58d823898f5ac69258ea7a44ed02ece617fb3fa9844c995af5b040009b50df8", "ja": "うん、頑張って落ち着いてみる……。\nあ、ねえねえ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯，我尽量冷静一下……\n啊，对了对了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "57d38e6d5ed80da8a2730e11fecf32bf44b2e67327c32a25af35e87a4d05c603", "ja": "この衣装って、{$P$}が\n選んでくれたんでしょ？　すごいな～。", "zh": "这套服装是{$P$}先生帮我选的吧？真厉害～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "76f1069a4500a42bbb7972e2c9c8d1a792331e307dad4898f4e8a67519ab2214", "ja": "どうしてこんなに、私の好みの衣装が\nわかっちゃうの？　気になるー！", "zh": "为什么会这么清楚我喜欢什么样的服装呀？真让人在意——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2e5477117a87e3060eee22c913ebbfd6724dd8d0df934eb2139b99f4b46573fa", "ja": "ただ海美に似合いそうなのを選んだだけだよ。\n実は、ギリギリまで悩んでたんだけど。", "zh": "我只是选了件看起来适合海美的服装而已。其实，我一直纠结到最后一刻呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c7663aae2181e44300b729e7708810815fd37e111858eda784c931296a35713c", "ja": "でも、悩んだ分、正解だったみたいだな。", "zh": "不过，纠结了这么久，看来还是选对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "24b9c3a0c4971697ec2fa26307e063cb48c185133a9c84c6e4189204cd717e0e", "ja": "うんうん、大正解！　私、テンションマックス！\n残りの撮影も、す～っごく頑張っちゃうね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，太正确了！我现在情绪拉满！\n接下来的拍摄，我也会超～～级努力的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "87ce91562dcf710e409d196d82fde937b362637e928edbc4b75fe1eaad8b36de", "ja": "今なら、女子力たっぷりの写真が撮れそう！\nよーしっ、それじゃあ行ってくるね！　レッツゴー☆", "zh": "现在感觉能拍出满满女子力的照片！  \n好——！那我先过去啦！出发☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0223_1019_p", "source_sha256": "22479241e4b16db524effc4506734060f9cd535038a1dfa974647e04bc9f96ff", "ja": "ああ、期待してるから……あっ、おーい！\n休憩！　海美、まだ休憩だから！　落ち着いて！", "zh": "啊啊，我很期待……啊，喂——！\n休息！海美，现在还是休息时间！冷静点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
